      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ardmore%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Toxic pollution and acidic waters from Hat Creek made the water supply non-drinkable, contributing to the abandonment of Ardmore.",
